<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner: I’m Falkner, the Violet City\nBlock Boss!\rPeople say you can clip a bird\nhomie’s wings with a lil taser...\rI won’t let NOBODY disrespect\nmy birds like that!\rI’ma show you what real\npigeon power look like!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner: ...For real?!\nMy pops’ precious birds...\rBut an L is an L.\nAight.\rTake this official Big\nLeague Chain.\fThis the Zephyr Chain.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Zephyr Chain from Falkner!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner: With that Chain, homies up\nto Lv. 20, even traded ones,\fwill listen to you, no questions.\rIt also let you use the hidden\nmove Smash n Grab outside of\fbattle, whenever.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner: Use a TM and a homie\nlearn a new move on the spot.\rThink before you use it--a TM\nonly work once.\rTM51 is Crash Pad.\nIt heal up half the max HP.\rThere’s blocks in the cities and\ntowns up ahead. Run ’em all!\rAs for where you go next...\fI’d hit up Azalea Town.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner: There’s blocks in the\ncities and towns up ahead.\rGo test yourself at\nall of ’em.\rAs for where you go next...\fI’d hit up Azalea Town.\rI’ma train harder so I can be\nthe greatest Pigeon Guy alive!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! Future Kingpin!\nYou here to run up on\fFalkner, the Block Boss, right?\rYou welcome here.\n...Kinda!\rThis city got a tower called\nSprout Tower where Hustlers\fgo get humbled.\rRunnin’ up on Falkner without that\ntraining? That’s crazy.\fHa ha ha!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo, future Kingpin!\nI ain’t a Hustler, but I got\fsome advice!\fTrust me!\fIf you believe, then that Kingpin\fdream can come true.\rYou believe?\nThen listen up.\rGrass types get cooked by\nFlying types. Remember that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hard battle! Keep that up and\nyou’ll be Kingpin in no time!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Violet City Block\nNo Birdseed Past This Point</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Violet City Block\rBlock Boss: Falkner\nGot Ran Through By:\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
